      "id": "direction",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -200,
      "w": 800,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "SNACK ARCADE — sticker-punk maximalism\n\nEverything is a sticker: 3px ink outline, hard offset shadow, a degree or two of rotation. Press and the shadow collapses under it. Bungee for nouns and numbers, Space Grotesk for sentences.\n\nBuilt on CalSnap's real tokens (coral / teal / gold / cyan / amber / hot) plus two additions — lime and violet — matched in chroma."
    },
    {
      "id": "sound-note",
